      },
      "content": "Pack to shipping the monitor, contact your supplier or local Nellcor office (Technical Services  Department)  for  a  returned  goods  authorization  number.  Mark  the  shipping carton  and  any  shipping  documents  with  the  returned  goods  authorization  (RGA) number. Return the N5500 by any method that provides proof of delivery.",
